            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dominant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dra i sirkelen for å endre grunnfargens kulør, eller trykk i midten for å starte fra en lagret farge. Metning og lyshet gjelder hele harmonien.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag in the wheel to change the base color’s hue, or tap the center to start from a saved color. Saturation and lightness apply to the whole harmony."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eksisterende paletter": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Existing palettes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eksporter": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endepunkter": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Endpoints"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enkeltfarger": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Single colors"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Et perseptuelt fargerom der like tallsteg oppleves som like store fargeforskjeller. Kolorist regner overganger i OKLab, og toneskalaer, lysere/mørkere trinn, harmonier og metning i OKLCH (lyshet, kroma, kulør).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A perceptual color space where equal numeric steps are perceived as equally large color differences. Kolorist computes gradients in OKLab, and tone scales, lighter/darker steps, harmonies and saturation in OKLCH (lightness, chroma, hue)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Etablert trykkteknikk; søket er utviklet for Kolorist": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Established print technique; the search was developed for Kolorist"
          }
        }
      }
